  },
  {
   "speaker": "Richard",
   "en": "Not too bad.",
   "zh": "不算太坏。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L103.mp4",
    "start": 10,
    "end": 11.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Richard",
   "en": "I think I passed in English and Mathematics.",
   "zh": "我想我的英语和数学及格了。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L103.mp4",
    "start": 11.4,
    "end": 14.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Richard",
   "en": "The questions were very easy.",
   "zh": "题目很容易。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L103.mp4",
    "start": 14.8,
    "end": 17.9
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Richard",
   "en": "How about you, Gary?",
   "zh": "加里，你怎么样？",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L103.mp4",
    "start": 17.9,
    "end": 20.6
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Gary",
   "en": "The English and Maths papers weren't easy enough for me.",
   "zh": "英语和数学试题对我来说不很容易。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L103.mp4",
    "start": 20.6,
    "end": 24.7
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Gary",
   "en": "I hope I haven't failed.",
   "zh": "我希望别不及格。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L103.mp4",
    "start": 24.7,
    "end": 27.7
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Richard",
   "en": "I think I failed the French paper.",
   "zh": "我想我的法语及不了格。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L103.mp4",
    "start": 27.7,
    "end": 30.6
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Richard",
   "en": "I could answer sixteen of the questions.",
   "zh": "我能回答其中的16道题。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L103.mp4",
    "start": 30.6,
    "end": 33.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Richard",
   "en": "They were very easy.",
   "zh": "这些题很容易。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L103.mp4",
    "start": 33.2,
    "end": 35.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Richard",
   "en": "But I couldn't answer the rest.",
   "zh": "但我回答不出其余的题。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L103.mp4",
    "start": 35.2,
    "end": 37.6
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Richard",
   "en": "They were too difficult for me.",
   "zh": "那些题对我来说太难了。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L103.mp4",
    "start": 37.6,
    "end": 40.3
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Gary",
   "en": "French tests are awful, aren't they?",
   "zh": "法语考试太可怕了，你说呢？",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L103.mp4",
    "start": 40.3,
    "end": 43.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Richard",
   "en": "I hate them.",
   "zh": "我讨厌法语考试。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L103.mp4",
    "start": 43.4,
    "end": 44.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Richard",
   "en": "I'm sure I've got a low mark.",
   "zh": "我的法语成绩肯定很低。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L103.mp4",
    "start": 44.8,
    "end": 47.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Gary",
   "en": "Oh, cheer up!",
   "zh": "啊，别灰心！",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L103.mp4",
    "start": 47.4,
    "end": 49.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Gary",
   "en": "Perhaps we didn't do too badly.",
   "zh": "或许我们考得还不太糟。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L103.mp4",
    "start": 49.4,
    "end": 51.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Gary",
   "en": "The guy next to me wrote his name at the top of the paper.",
   "zh": "坐在我旁边的那个人只在试卷顶端写了自己的名字。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L103.mp4",
    "start": 51.8,
    "end": 55.6
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Richard",
   "en": "Yes?",
   "zh": "是吗？",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L103.mp4",
    "start": 55.6,
    "end": 56.9
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Gary",
   "en": "Then he sat there and looked at it for three hours!",
   "zh": "然后他就坐在那里，对着考卷看了3个小时，",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L103.mp4",
    "start": 56.9,
    "end": 60.9
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Gary",
   "en": "He didn't write a word!",
   "zh": "一个字也没写！",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L103.mp4",
    "start": 60.9,
    "end": 63.6
   }
  }
